 * OOP concepts used:
 *  1. Class & Object   - Board, Player, AICoach, Leaderboard, Game
 *  2. Encapsulation    - private data + public methods
 *  3. Inheritance      - HumanPlayer, ComputerPlayer : Player
 *  4. Abstraction      - Player is an abstract class
 *  5. Polymorphism     - virtual getMove(), newRound(), isHuman()
 *  6. Constructors/Destructors
 *  7. Composition      - Game HAS-A Board, Game HAS-A Players
 *  8. Static members   - Game::totalGames, AICoach (static methods)
 *  9. Enumeration      - enum class Difficulty
 * 10. Recursion + STL  - minimax search, vector, map, sort
 * 11. File handling    - persistent leaderboard (leaderboard.txt)
 *
 * USP - "AI COACH":
 *  (a) Three difficulty levels: Easy, Medium and Hard (unbeatable
